OL,3,AUS military newspaper editor voices
OL,4,Acensorship fears after being fired
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe editor-in-chief of US military
OL,7,Fnewspaper Stars and Stripes has told
OL,8,Fthe BBC of his concern over censorship
OL,9,Fa day after being dismissed by the US
OL,10,FDepartment of Defense (DoD) for
OL,11,F"insubordination".
OL,13,F"This is a time when we really need to
OL,14,Fhear what's happening," Erik Slavin
OL,15,Fsaid, adding that Pentagon officials
OL,16,Fappeared to be "less and less inclined
OL,17,Fto speak on the record".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
