OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS military newspaper editor voices
OL,4,Acensorship fears after being fired
OL,5,
OL,6,FSlavin says he believes he was fired
OL,7,Ffor having stated in an interview that
OL,8,F"in a hypothetical situation,
OL,9,Fcensorship would be a red line". A
OL,10,Freporter and the paper's publisher were
OL,11,Falso sacked.
OL,13,FThe Pentagon told the BBC it would not
OL,14,Fcomment. But the sackings come amid
OL,15,Ftension between the Trump
OL,16,Fadministration and the US media.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
